  "comment": "Source registry for the daily AI newspaper. status: 'verified' = live-tested via deep research on 2026-08-07; 'candidate' = named in research but feed not yet tested. The fetcher should tolerate empty arXiv feeds on weekends/holidays and follow redirects (takara.ai 307s).",
